      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for explaining. it's wild how much they are working in there without us seeing it. i guess when people say it's \"unpredictable\" they're just talking about those stochastic events? like, can the whole thing just suddenly go bad or get weird for no reason, or is it always traceable back to something like temp or feeding?",
